# CQ6: How much does each pizza on the menu cost, and in which currency?
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX pizza: <https://ebrahimnorouzi.github.io/pizza-ontology/pizza.owl#>
PREFIX pr: <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/price.owl#>
SELECT ?pizza ?amount ?currency WHERE {
  ?item pr:hasPrice ?price ; rdfs:label ?pizza .
  ?price pr:hasValue ?amount ; pr:hasCurrency ?c .
  ?c rdfs:label ?currency .
} ORDER BY ?pizza
